# Provenance Notice

Timeline Filter for X is based on “Hide Verified Twitter Users” by the GitHub user `sardistic`:

- Upstream repository: https://github.com/sardistic/Hide-Verified-Twitter-Users
- Base commit: `d001274cc9e466c0ba229f9600a52755948035e7`
- Upstream license: CC0 1.0 Universal

The upstream license text is preserved in `LICENSE`. This derivative, including its later modifications, is also released under CC0 1.0 Universal.

Substantial changes in this derivative include:

- distinguishing paid individual verification from business, government, and legacy verification;
- keeping ordinary video and GIF posts visible;
- filtering replies while preserving a post opened by its direct URL;
- optional filters for X's AI-generation labels and non-Japanese posts;
- handling quote cards, delayed X markup, missing API metadata, and X automatic translation;
- regression coverage for filtering and visibility stability;
- a separate product name, interface, documentation, and original icon.

The icon source in `assets/icon-source.svg` was created specifically for this derivative and does not reuse the upstream icon or X Corp. brand marks.

This project is independently maintained. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, sponsored by, or an official successor to the upstream project, its author, or X Corp. “X” and “Twitter” are used only to identify the compatible service.
